# pos_auto_takeoff.scn — ground mode change + POS_HOLD auto-takeoff (spec 2026-06-11)
#                        地上モード変更＋POS_HOLD 自動離陸（仕様変更 2026-06-11）
#
# Same chain as alt_auto_takeoff.scn but in POS_HOLD: the auto-takeoff climb must
# also HOLD THE LAUNCH POINT horizontally (the position cascade runs during the
# climb with the launch capture), and after the climb the craft parks over the
# spot it took off from.
# alt_auto_takeoff.scn と同じ連鎖を POS_HOLD で: 自動離陸の上昇中は「発進点の水平
# 保持」も行い（上昇中も位置カスケードが発進点捕捉で動く）、上昇後は離陸地点の
# 真上で停止する。
#
# Run: sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/pos_auto_takeoff.scn --target vehicle_new
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        0     0     1  # B: POS switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        0     0     1  # C: ARM in POS_HOLD — props must stay stopped
   +    rc   3330  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50        0     0     1  # D: throttle up → AUTO-takeoff (0.3 m/s, hold launch point)
   +    rc   3072  2048   2048    2048  1     6000      50        0     0     1  # E: stick to center → hold altitude + position 6 s
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50                       # F: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     200       50                       # G: press again → DISARM (toggle)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # H: settle disarmed
